message: "If CNEquity supports your research or data work, please cite this repository."
type: software
title: "CNEquity"
abstract: >-
  A free, self-hosted financial data infrastructure for China markets, starting
  with A-shares and providing multi-source ingestion, provenance, adjustment
  semantics, point-in-time fundamentals, and reproducible Parquet storage.
version: 0.10.0.dev0
authors:
  - name: "CNEquity Contributors"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/rootSunc/CNEquity"
url: "https://rootsunc.github.io/CNEquity/"
keywords:
  - A-shares
  - financial data
  - data lake
  - quantitative finance
  - Parquet
  - point-in-time data
